# REQUIRES: python-api
# The thermostats of the control file and Brownian dynamics as fields of
# the Python model (D249, #278): `Ensemble.thermostat`,
# `Ensemble.friction`, `Ensemble.chain_length`, `Ensemble.coupling_period`,
# and `Integrator.friction` with their defaults and types, the refusals of
# the control file with its words, and `Program.plan["thermostat"]` and
# `["integrator"]`; Inputs/python_thermostats.py, scenario refusals, which
# needs no device.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_thermostats.py %S/Inputs CPU Double mdir %t refusals | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: thermostats refusals passed
